        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-11T02:27:15.671Z",
          "html": "<p>Done: the 4px is back on the left of a body's lines, so they start where they did before C14 (12px from the gutter at this size).</p>\n<epic-net-effect><ul><li>Every body, both pages; C14's change is undone.</li></ul></epic-net-effect>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-11T02:20:09.866Z"
      }
    },
    "c24": {
      "anchor": "solitaire-to-play-from-the-stock",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "",
      "excerpt": "",
      "text": "white text extends beyond the pill, screenshot and see",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-11T02:18:11.798Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "edited": "2026-11-11T02:18:38.818Z",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-11T02:27:17.748Z",
          "html": "<p>Found it by measuring all 134 bands: the docs page caps a paragraph's width, so a long band stopped short and its last pill ran on past its colour. Bands and lines have no cap now; measured again, no band or pill has text past its box (218 pills, 134 bands).</p>\n<epic-net-effect><ul><li>Long bands are as long as their words; the box scrolls sideways for the longest descriptions.</li></ul></epic-net-effect>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-11T02:20:12.185Z"
      }
    },
    "c25": {
