          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-11T02:27:19.775Z",
          "html": "<p>Done: the curly quotes are inside the pill's white now, a little darker, with a gap between each and the words.</p>\n<epic-net-effect><ul><li>Every quoted pill, both pages (<code>--bub-quote-ink</code>, <code>--bub-quote-gap</code>).</li></ul></epic-net-effect>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
