          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-11T02:27:22.297Z",
          "html": "<p>Done: <q>T3</q> is a white pill. On a declaration's line, everything typed is a pill now, its worked-out part too: quoted texts, numbers, and a list's values (<code>suit = <span>diamonds</span></code>). In a step under it, values stay italic (C17-C19).</p>\n<epic-net-effect><ul><li>Every declaration's line on the page, e.g. all seven tableaus and four foundations, and the card's <code>if its rank is jack, queen or king</code>.</li></ul></epic-net-effect>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
